<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Polish wallpaper playback: stop tearing, loop hits, and silent failures</li>
    <li>Refactor assignment, menu snapshot, and yt-dlp install seams</li>
    <li>Redirect root todos to _docs backlog and fix map paths.</li>
    <li>Split audit closure from active todos and add docs map.</li>
    <li>Design + logic audit: HIG standardization and Apple-docs correctness hardening</li>
    <li>Pause wallpaper video playback when the panel is fully occluded (#29)</li></ul>
<p class="footer">MovingPaper 0.041 -- your desktop, alive.</p>
]]></description>
